flowchart TD
    Commit["Reviewed commit merged to main"]
    Docs["Validate documentation and OpenAPI"]
    Checks["Compile, static analysis, tests and security checks"]
    Build["Build frontend and backend"]
    Image["Build linux/amd64 + linux/arm64 OCI image"]
    Scan["Dependency and vulnerability scan"]
    GHCR["Publish immutable image to GHCR<br/>commit SHA + content digest"]
    Approval{"Manual owner approval<br/>for private dev"}
    NotDeployed["Not deployed<br/>await approval or close the deployment"]
    Target["Validate Always Free target<br/>and secret references"]
    Recovery["Confirm backup and recovery preconditions"]
    Migration["Run one serialized Flyway migration job"]
    Replace["Replace application container<br/>using the selected digest"]
    Ready{"Readiness passes?"}
    Smoke["Run smoke and accessibility journey checks"]
    Record["Record source, digest, migration and observed outcome"]
    Decision{"Deployment decision"}
    Accept["Accept private dev deployment"]
    ForwardFix["Forward-fix through a new reviewed change"]
    Restore["Restore previous application image<br/>when schema-compatible"]
    Failed["Record failed deployment<br/>old healthy version is not a success"]

    Commit --> Docs --> Checks --> Build --> Image --> Scan --> GHCR --> Approval
    Approval -->|Approved| Target --> Recovery --> Migration --> Replace --> Ready
    Approval -->|Not approved| NotDeployed

    Ready -->|Yes| Smoke --> Record --> Decision
    Ready -->|No| Failed --> Decision

    Decision -->|Accept| Accept
    Decision -->|Forward-fix| ForwardFix --> Commit
    Decision -->|Restore| Restore --> Record

    Note["Rules:<br/>• never deploy latest<br/>• no concurrent dev deployments<br/>• application rollback does not imply database rollback"]
    Note -.-> Migration
    Note -.-> GHCR

    classDef ci fill:#f5f0ff,stroke:#7c3aed,stroke-width:2px,color:#4c1d95
    classDef deploy fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,stroke-width:2px,color:#7c2d12
    classDef decision fill:#ecfeff,stroke:#0891b2,stroke-width:2px,color:#164e63
    classDef success fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px,color:#14532d
    classDef failure fill:#fff1f2,stroke:#e11d48,stroke-width:2px,color:#881337
    class Commit,Docs,Checks,Build,Image,Scan,GHCR ci
    class Target,Recovery,Migration,Replace,Smoke,Record deploy
    class Approval,NotDeployed,Ready,Decision decision
    class Accept success
    class Failed,ForwardFix,Restore failure
